    "identifier": "quivering-strike",
    "description": "<p>When you hit a creature with an unarmed attack, you can spend 5 Martial Die to infuse its body with vibrations that can shatter their bones. At the end of each of their turns, the affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, they take 5 Martial Dice worth of bludgeoning damage, which cannot be reduced or ignored by any means. On a successful save, they end this effect. A creature can only be under the effect of this technique once per rest.</p>",
